# Tarikh — redirects for Netlify and Cloudflare Pages.
#
# http -> https and apex (tarikh.tech) -> www.tarikh.tech are NOT handled here.
# Set them as primary-domain / "redirect apex to primary" rules in the host
# dashboard so the hop happens at the edge instead of in the app. See
# deploy/REDIRECTS.md.
#
# Old flat file paths -> clean URLs. One 301 hop each.

/index.html                                 /                              301
/features.html                              /features                      301
/pricing.html                               /pricing                       301
/privacy.html                               /privacy                       301
/terms.html                                 /terms                         301
/blog/index.html                            /blog/                         301
/blog/blog-post-nepal-court-hierarchy.html  /blog/nepal-court-hierarchy    301

# Anything else that does not exist gets the 404 page with a real 404 status.
# Real files always win over a splat rule, so this only catches unknown paths.
/*                                          /404.html                      404
